  "body": "The HTTP-network fetch algorithm currently queues \"process request body\" tasks, which also need to be queued by HTTP fetch as otherwise the service worker doing `event.request.text()` is not defined.\n\nSimilarly, text for response updating probably needs to be included.\n\nBoth of these changes also prepare us for streams.\n",
